  "content": [
    {
      "text": "the Lord despises those who are puffed up because of learning, wisdom, riches, 2 Ne. 9:42. many shall be puffed up in hearts and seek deep to hide counsels from the Lord, 2 Ne. 28:9, 12–15. those who are puffed up in vain things of world have gone astray, Alma 5:37. men cry unto God with mouths while they are puffed up with vain things of world, Alma 31:27. Satan puffed people up in pride, 3 Ne. 6:15. charity is not puffed up, Moro. 7:45 (1 Cor. 13:4).",
